### Ingest the bundled primer doc (one-click test)
POST http://localhost:8080/rag/ingest/sample

### Ingest any file of your own (PDF, docx, html, md, txt...)
# Point the filename at a real file on disk.
POST http://localhost:8080/rag/ingest
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----myrag

------myrag
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="mydoc.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./mydoc.pdf
------myrag--

### Search — the retrieval half of RAG, no LLM
GET http://localhost:8080/rag/search?query=why chunk documents&topK=4

### Search — meaning match, not keyword match
GET http://localhost:8080/rag/search?query=how do I get my money back&topK=3
